('Cleaning', '<ul><li>Microfiber cloths — they lift dust instead of spreading it and can be washed hundreds of times.</li><li>A floor cleaner, a dishwash liquid and a multi-surface spray.</li><li>A refillable spray bottle so you can dilute concentrates.</li><li>Garbage bags in the right size for your bin — check the dimensions, not just the litre number.</li></ul>'),
('Safety and first aid', '<ul><li>A basic first-aid kit: adhesive bandages, sterile gauze, antiseptic, medical tape, scissors, a digital thermometer and any regular medicines.</li><li>An LED torch or emergency light for power cuts.</li><li>A surge-protected extension board with the ISI mark for electronics.</li></ul><p>Check expiry dates in the first-aid kit every six months.</p>'),
